    "notes": "<h2><strong>Description:</strong></h2>\n<h3>Data Files:</h3>\n<div>\n<ul>\n<li>Error_vs_N_2025-10-01_22_56.npz&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;-- Numerical data analysis used to generate Fig.2 (generated by Inverse_Pump_Problem_Analysis.ipynb))</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n<div>\n<ul>\n<li>Error_vs_N_stat2025-10-07_06_08.npz&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;-- Numerical data analysis used to generate Fig.2 (generated by Inverse_Pump_Problem_Analysis.ipynb)</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n<div>\n<ul>\n<li>Error_vs_N_2025-10-01_22_56.npz&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;-- Numerical data analysis used to generate Fig.2</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n<div>\n<ul>\n<li>Error_vs_N_stat2025-10-07_06_08.npz&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;-- Numerical data analysis used to generate Fig.2</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n<div>\n<ul>\n<li>Data_Img.hdf5&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; -- JPA Experimental Data for Image of Fig. 5</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n<div>\n<ul>\n<li>PeaceFilmx2_BW_96x151.png&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; -- Original image used for the experiment of Fig. 5</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n<div>\n<ul>\n<li>Stargets_Image_PeaceFilmx2_BW_96x151.npz&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;-- Numerical data, and Numerical scattering matrix corresponding to experiment of Fig. 5</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n<div>\n<ul>\n<li>2025-11.hdf5&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;-- Dataset used for Fig. 3 and Fig. 4</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n<div>\n<p>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;Contains:</p>\n</div>\n<div>\n<p>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; 1.&nbsp; '2025-11-14_10_23_31'&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; -- Dataset to create Fig.3</p>\n<p>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; 2.&nbsp; '2025-11-21_16_40_49'&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; -- Dataset to create Fig.4</p>\n</div>\n<div>\n<ul>\n<li>Sexp_abs_dB_3.npz&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; -- Extracted data from 2025-11.hdf5 for Figure 3</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n<div>\n<ul>\n<li>S_tar_dB_13_best.npz&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;-- Extracted data from 2025-11.hdf5 for Figure 4</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n<div>\n<ul>\n<li>Sexp_abs_dB_13_best.npz&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; -- Extracted data from 2025-11.hdf5 for Figure 4</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\n<h3>Data Folders:</h3>\n<div>\n<ul>\n<li>Folders.zip</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n<div>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;Contains:</div>\n<p>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; 1.&nbsp; Scattering&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;-- Contains the pumping scheme used for the experiment of Fig. 3</p>\n<p>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; 2.&nbsp; Pumping Scheme NonRec&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;-- Contains the pumping scheme used for the experiment of Fig. 4</p>\n<h3>Figure Scripts:</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>Figures_InversePumpProblem_Fig2.ipynb&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; -- Jupiter notebook script to generate Fig.2</li>\n<li>Figures_InversePumpProblem_Fig3.ipynb&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; -- Jupiter notebook script to generate Fig.3</li>\n<li>Figures_InversePumpProblem_Fig4.ipynb&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; -- Jupiter notebook script to generate Fig.4</li>\n<li>Figures_InversePumpProblem_Fig5.ipynb&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; -- Jupiter notebook script to generate Fig.5</li>\n</ul>\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\n<h3>Data Analysis Scripts:</h3>\n<div>\n<ul>\n<li>Inverse_Pump_Problem_Analysis.ipynb&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;-- Script that perform the numerical study of validation of the PPM behind Fig.2&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n<div>\n<ul>\n<li>Img2Scattering.ipynb&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;-- Script to generate pumping scheme to recreate an image (used to generate the pumping scheme that generates Fig. 5 )</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n<div>\n<ul>\n<li>inverse_problem_visualize_&amp;_savedata.ipynb&nbsp; -- Script to Visualize and save npz files to generate Fig. 3 and Fig. 4</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\n<h3>Libraries:</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>myPy_functions.py&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; -- Library of functions with inverse (PPM) and direct scattering problems solver and other functions used to analyzed data</li>\n<li>PyPump.py&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; -- Library with functions of the PPM problem only</li>\n</ul>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>"
